International Conference, CONCUR 2014, Rome, Italy, September 2-5, 2014. Proceedings","title":"CONCUR 2014 – Concurrency Theory"},"review":"Peer Reviewed","scoID":["2-s2.0-84906772581"],"search":{"DAF":["All Danish Affiliations","All Universities","DI-ALL","DI-U","DI-U-ALL","IT University of Copenhagen","Universities","University of Southern Denmark"],"PST":["Published"]},"sid":["sdu-e87a3f1b-eae6-4ff3-861b-b87f60273249"],"src":["SDU University of Southern Denmark"],"title":"Choreographies, Logically","type":"Conference Paper","url":"https://local.forskningsportal.dk/search?modus=sin&s=LOI:S01-000.00-639762","year":"2014","yearsub":"2014"}
